01:01:57.350 --> 01:02:08.060
<v Elna Baker>Thanks, as always, to my boss, Ira Glass. You know, he told me he does the same thing every Saturday night. He watches the Eminem movie, 8 Mile, shotguns a tall boy, stares at himself in the mirror.

01:02:08.060 --> 01:02:09.590
<v Mary Gray>And I just start rapping.

